## Log set
tone: Neutral
--- discord ---
### Log channel
Quack posts moderation log entries in this staff-only channel.
**Log channel:** <#444>
select Setup(Log, Channel) "Choose a channel": text channels
buttons: [Create #moderation-log · Secondary] Setup(Log, Create) | [Stop posting log entries · Secondary] Setup(Log, Clear) | [Back · Secondary] Setup(Home, Open)
--- plain ---
Log channel
Quack posts moderation log entries in this staff-only channel.
Log channel: #moderation-log
--- model ---
Heading [Fixed("Log channel")]
Text [Fixed("Quack posts moderation log entries in this staff-only channel.")]
Field "Log channel" [Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("moderation-log") })]

