## Appeals set
tone: Neutral
--- discord ---
### Appeals
New appeals are posted in this staff-only channel for moderators to review. Quack can include a rejoin invite in DMs about accepted appeals for kicks and bans.
**Appeals:** <#444>, rejoin invite set
select Setup(Appeals, Channel) "Choose a channel": text channels
buttons: [Create #appeals · Secondary] Setup(Appeals, Create) | [Stop posting appeals · Secondary] Setup(Appeals, Clear) | [Set rejoin invite · Secondary] Setup(Appeals, SetInvite) | [Remove invite · Secondary] Setup(Appeals, ClearInvite) | [Back · Secondary] Setup(Home, Open)
--- plain ---
Appeals
New appeals are posted in this staff-only channel for moderators to review. Quack can include a rejoin invite in DMs about accepted appeals for kicks and bans.
Appeals: #appeals, rejoin invite set
--- model ---
Heading [Fixed("Appeals")]
Text [Fixed("New appeals are posted in this staff-only channel for moderators to review. Quack can include a rejoin invite in DMs about accepted appeals for kicks and bans.")]
Field "Appeals" [Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("appeals") }), Fixed(", rejoin invite set")]

