## Tickets set
tone: Neutral
--- discord ---
### Tickets
Members open private tickets from a button in the entry channel. Staff see new tickets in the staff channel.
**Tickets:** On · members open tickets in <#444> · new tickets go to <#444>
select Setup(Tickets, TicketEntry) "Channel where members open tickets": text channels
select Setup(Tickets, TicketQueue) "Staff channel for new tickets": text channels
buttons: [Create #support and #ticket-log · Secondary] Setup(Tickets, Create) | [Turn off · Secondary] Setup(Tickets, TurnOff) | [Back · Secondary] Setup(Home, Open)
--- plain ---
Tickets
Members open private tickets from a button in the entry channel. Staff see new tickets in the staff channel.
Tickets: On · members open tickets in #support · new tickets go to #ticket-log
--- model ---
Heading [Fixed("Tickets")]
Text [Fixed("Members open private tickets from a button in the entry channel. Staff see new tickets in the staff channel.")]
Field "Tickets" [Fixed("On · members open tickets in "), Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("support") }), Fixed(" · new tickets go to "), Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("ticket-log") })]

