## Honeypot set
tone: Neutral
--- discord ---
### Honeypot
When the honeypot is on, a member who posts in this channel gets a case under the chosen rule. Quack ignores posts from staff and bots.
**Honeypot:** On · <#444> · rule **Honeypot**
select Setup(Honeypot, Channel) "Choose a channel": text channels
select Setup(Honeypot, Rule) "Rule the honeypot applies": Honeypot (Posting in the honeypot channel.)
buttons: [Create #honeypot · Secondary] Setup(Honeypot, Create) | [Edit warning · Secondary] Setup(Honeypot, EditWarning) | [Turn off · Secondary] Setup(Honeypot, TurnOff) | [Back · Secondary] Setup(Home, Open)
--- plain ---
Honeypot
When the honeypot is on, a member who posts in this channel gets a case under the chosen rule. Quack ignores posts from staff and bots.
Honeypot: On · #honeypot · rule Honeypot
--- model ---
Heading [Fixed("Honeypot")]
Text [Fixed("When the honeypot is on, a member who posts in this channel gets a case under the chosen rule. Quack ignores posts from staff and bots.")]
Field "Honeypot" [Fixed("On · "), Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("honeypot") }), Fixed(" · rule "), Bold([User("Honeypot")])]

